flowchart LR
  %% The parcels system, as its demos draw it (packs.demo.diagrams in axx.yaml). A box is
  %% named as the scenarios name what they talk to. A solid line is a call that is answered,
  %% a dotted one an event: sent, and read by whoever listens, when they do.
  shop([shop]) --> portal --> parcels
  shop --> parcels
  parcels --> parcels-db[(parcels-db)]
  parcels --> addresses
  parcels -.-> parcel-events{{parcel-events}} -.-> billing
  subgraph partners
    addresses
    billing
  end
